          <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="body-md">This demo Privacy Policy describes the types of information that may be collected when you visit this website or contact TRG Snow Tech Training &amp; Consulting LLC (“TRG,” “we,” “us,” or “our”), and how that information may be used. Replace this content with counsel-approved language before launch.</p>
